  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka man otum, Nakac kabaka pa jo Ammon oto woko, ci wode oleyo ka tyene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owacci, “Abinyuto cwiny me mar bot Kanun wod pa Nakac, kit ma yam wonne onyuto cwiny me mar bota-ni.” Mumiyo Daudi ocwalo lukwena bote ka kweyo cwinye pi to pa wonne, Lutic pa Daudi guo bot Kanun i lobo pa jo Ammon ka kweyo cwinye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento rwodi pa jo Ammon guwaco bot Kanun ni, “In itamo ni Daudi ocwalo lukwe cwinyi pi keto deyo i kom woru? Daudi mono pe ocwalo luticce ka ŋiyo piny, ki ka turo gaŋ, ki pi roto lobo ducu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno omiyo Kanun omako lutic pa Daudi, ci olyelo yer tikgi, ka dok oŋolo dye boŋogi i kom pyergi, ka ocwalogi kwede woko; ci gucito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gitito bot Daudi pi jo meno, ci ocwalo dano ka jologi, pien onoŋo gitye ki lewic madwoŋ twatwal. Ci kabaka owacci, “Koŋ wubed i Jeriko, nio ka yer tikwu otwi olot, ka doŋ wudwog kany.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jo Ammon guneno ni pigi odoko ŋwe marac bot Daudi, ci Kanun ki jo Ammon gucwalo ryal ma romo talanta alip acel ka wilo gadigadi lweny ki wegi aguragura ki bot jo Mecopotamia, wa ki i lobo Arammaaka, ki i Joba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci guwilo gadigadi lweny alip pyeradek wiye aryo, ki kabaka me Maaka bene, ma onoŋo obino ki monnye, ogony i nyim Medeba. Jo Ammon bene gucokke ki i gaŋigi, gubino ka lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Daudi owinyo pigi, ci ocwalo Joab kacel ki mony pa twoni oteka lweny ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci jo Ammon gubino gurwayo cok ka guryeyo i dog gaŋ; luker ma gubino guryeyo kengi, i dye bar. 403",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Joab oneno mony okace woko ryoryo, tuŋ nyime ki yo tuŋ ŋeye bene, ci oyero jo Icrael ma oyita lweny, ocako ryeyogi gukemo jo Ciria; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oketo jo mudoŋŋe bot ominne Abicai, gin bene guryeyo gukemo jo Ammon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joab owacci, “Ka ce jo Ciria gubedo tek i koma, ci ibikonya, ento ka jo Ammon aye gubedo tek i komi, an abikonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bed oteka ma cwinye nwaŋ, wek walweny pi lutuwa, ki pi gaŋi pa Lubaŋawa, Rwot bene otim gin ma oneno ni ber.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno Joab ki jo ma gitye kwede ducu gurwayo cok ka lweny i kom jo Ciria; ci jo Ciria guriŋo woko ki i nyime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jo Ammon guneno jo Ciria guriŋo woko, ci gin bene gucako riŋo woko ki i nyim Abicai omin Joab, gudonyo wa i gaŋ, Ci Joab obino i Jerucalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka jo Ciria guneno jo Icrael guloyogi, gucwalo lukwena ci gukelo jo Ciria ma gitye loka Euprate, kacel ki Copak ma lawimony pa Adadejer ma latel wigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gitito pigi bot Daudi, ci en bene ocoko jo Icrael ducu oŋolo kwedgi kulu Jordan, ci obino i komgi, oryeyo monnye orwayo i komgi. Ka Daudi doŋ oryeyo monnye, orwayo kom jo Ciria, gucako lweny kwede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Ciria gucako riŋo woko ki i nyim Icrael; Daudi oneko jo Ciria ma romo riŋo ki gadigadi lweny alip abiro, ki askari ma woto ki tyengi alip pyeraŋwen, ka dok oneko Copak ladit me monygi bene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lutic pa Adadejer guneno jo Icrael gutyeko loyogi woko, ci guketo kuc i kingi ki Daudi, ci gudoko luticce. Kit meno jo Ciria pe dok gubedo ki miti me konyo jo Ammon i kare mo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
